re feet and prices starting from 1.08 Cr to 2.66 Cr.\n\n### What are the amenities offered in this project?\n\nThe project features several amenities, including power backup, 24 x 7 security, normal park, central green, kids play areas, sand pits, and indoor games.\n\n### What is the location of this project, and what are the nearby infrastructure developments? [...] Squareyards Logo\nSambhavparshva Developers developer logo\n\n# Sambhavparshva Tsaaya Kandivali East, Mumbai\n\n₹1.65 Cr - 4.06 Cr\n\n₹35,700 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Sambhavparshva Tsaaya?\n\n## About Sambhavparshva Tsaaya, Kandivali East by Sambhavparshva Developers\n\nSambhavparshva Tsaaya, a forthcoming residential project, offers a unique blend of comfort, convenience, and luxury in the heart of Kandivali East. Strategically located on Swami Vivekanand Road and Western Express Highway, the project makes it easy for residents to navigate through the city. With a valid RERA registration number P51800046545, owners can rely on the project s quality and timely delivery.","score":0.7977322346756944,"raw_content":null,"id":"5b2205-07"}],"response_time":5.73,"request_id":"561a57cc-17f6-444e-9aa7-26f89b2863a4"}